This crate talks to Blackmagic Design DeckLink hardware through the Desktop
Video SDK (16.0). The SDK headers, dispatch sources, and runtime libraries are
not redistributed by this repository. You must obtain the SDK and Desktop Video
drivers from Blackmagic Design and accept their EULA:

  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/EULA/DeckLinkSDK
  https://www.blackmagicdesign.com/desktopvideo_sdk

Set DECKLINK_SDK_DIR to the unpacked SDK root when building with hardware
support. On Windows the build also needs the Visual Studio C++ toolchain and
midl.exe so that DeckLinkAPI.idl can be compiled. On Linux the installed
libDeckLinkAPI.so is loaded at runtime. On macOS the DeckLinkAPI.framework
bundle is loaded at runtime.

